                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "228529070",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198276800952",
                            "num_reviews": 38,
                            "playtime_forever": 486,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 486,
                            "last_played": 1782173590
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A fun game that you will probably enjoy if you like the classic Mega Man titles (1-11). I'm not a pro gamer but I was able to clear hard mode (and there are two lesser difficulties available if it's too much for you). Overall I had a good time. Not the greatest pixel art in the world IMO but the chiptune was pretty good and the stages/bosses were neat. The only thing I ran into during my playthrough is that pausing the game crashed the game every time. Not sure if that has been fixed (I played this a long time ago). Hopefully so because otherwise it was a good experience!\n\nEdit: It is still not fixed. The game crashes 100% of the time when you unpause. Apparently others have this same issue. That's a shame.",
